  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development and Economic Growth Research Programme (DEGRP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Purpose is high quality evidence on growth generated and incorporated into policy by developing countries. This will be achieved through three programme Outputs (1) high quality policy relevant research on key questions of economic growth relating to finance and agriculture in developing countries, particularly LICs (2) the evidence base on growth and agriculture  finance, including research findings from this programme, disseminated effectively to key policy and decision makers; and (3) strengthened capacity of Southern researchers to lead and manage research.</narrative>
  </description>
